1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
(Penny:)Is he quitting his job
at the university?

2
00:00:02,279 --> 00:00:04,109
Oh, no. He's gonna telecommute.

3
00:00:04,281 --> 00:00:06,871
(Leonard:)Everybody's really excited about it.

4
00:00:07,493 --> 00:00:11,033
(Sheldon:)All right. Boone, North Carolina.

5
00:00:11,205 --> 00:00:14,495
"Every summer since 1952,
Boone has hosted...

6
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:17,667
(Sheldon:)...an outdoor amphitheater portrayal
of the life and times...

7
00:00:17,836 --> 00:00:21,716
...of its namesake: Danel Boone."

8
00:00:21,882 --> 00:00:25,512
That sounds like something
that would attract the wrong crowd.

9
00:00:27,721 --> 00:00:31,311
(Sheldon:)-Penny, you're from Nebraska, correct?
-Born and raised.

10
00:00:36,814 --> 00:00:41,314
(Sheldon:)It will take me a few days to get settled.
After I do, I will e-mail you...

11
00:00:41,485 --> 00:00:44,155
(Sheldon:)...detailed PDFs containing diagrams
and instructions...

12
00:00:44,321 --> 00:00:47,491
(Sheldon:)...that will guide you through packing
and shipping my possessions...

13
00:00:47,658 --> 00:00:50,158
(Sheldon:)...to Bozeman, Montana.

14
00:00:50,369 --> 00:00:52,999
(Sheldon:)In the meantime,
please forward my mail.

15
00:00:53,163 --> 00:00:58,023
Anyplace specific, or just
the Bozeman, Montana loony bin?

